      "desc": "A commemorative namecard for the New Eridu City Fund: Growth Plan.",
      "desc2": "\"Ta-da! This is the guestbook everyone signed after the tea party we hosted last time! Let's read it together, Wise~\"\n\"Sure. Though... 'Baby, you're a little blueberry!'... What's that supposed to mean?\"\n\"Hmm... I think they're saying the afternoon tea outfit I picked for you was adorable!\"\n\"What? Are you really calling your big brother adorable? Surely you're way cuter, Belle? You don't even need an outfit to be a little blueberry.\"",
